PHASE 11 — Parent Portal for Child Learners

Goal:
Build the parent portal for child learners.

Parent pages:
- /parent/dashboard
- /parent/children
- /parent/child/[id]
- /parent/child/[id]/progress
- /parent/child/[id]/lessons
- /parent/child/[id]/homework
- /parent/child/[id]/session-notes
- /parent/child/[id]/balance
- /parent/book
- /parent/notifications
- /parent/contact

Parent dashboard should show:
- Child progress
- Upcoming lesson
- Homework status
- Teacher notes
- Payment/package balance
- Level/literacy check result
- Recommended first lesson
- WhatsApp/contact shortcuts
- Badges/streaks for child

Security:
- Parent can only see linked child/children.

Acceptance criteria:
- Parent sees only linked child data.
- Parent sees child package balance.
- Parent sees upcoming lessons.
- Parent can request/book/reschedule lesson.
- Parent sees homework status and teacher notes.

Manual test checklist:
- Log in as demo parent.
- Confirm child dashboard.
- Try accessing unlinked child URL.
- Confirm blocked.
- Book/reschedule child lesson.

Stop condition:
Stop here. Test this phase before continuing.
